# _redirects — Civil Engineering Suite (Cloudflare Pages)
# Static path rewrites: public/* files served at clean URLs
# 200 = silent rewrite (no URL change in browser)
# Must be placed BEFORE any catch-all rules.
#
# FIX 3A — Fonts: /fonts/* → /public/fonts/:splat
#   Physical location: public/fonts/*.woff2
#   Browser requests:  /fonts/*.woff2
#   Without this rewrite, all font requests 404.
#
# FIX 3B — Images: /footing-pro/images/* and /images/*
#   Physical location: public/footing-pro/images/* and public/images/*
#   Browser requests:  /footing-pro/images/* and /images/*
#   These rewrites must exist for images to load at all.
#
# FIX L1 — Landing pages: /footing-pro/{engineers,offices,students}/
#   Physical location: footing-pro/{engineers,offices,students}/index.html
#   (lives at the REPO ROOT — NOT inside public/)
#   Root cause of 404 (fixed 2026-06-03):
#     The previous _redirects had rewrite rules pointing these paths to
#     /public/footing-pro/{segment}/:splat. That /public/ subdirectory does
#     NOT contain the landing HTML files — they live at repo root under
#     footing-pro/{segment}/index.html (committed directly, not encrypted).
#     When [[path]].js calls context.next() for these paths, Cloudflare
#     applies _redirects first. The incorrect /public/ rewrite sent the
#     request to a path that doesn't exist → 404.
#   Fix: removed the 3 incorrect /public/ rewrite rules entirely. Without
#   those rules, Cloudflare's static file serving finds footing-pro/
#   {segment}/index.html directly at the repo-root location. No redirect
#   rule is needed because the files are already at the correct serving path.

# FIX K2 — KaTeX vendor assets: /vendor/katex/* → /public/vendor/katex/:splat
#   Physical location: public/vendor/katex/{katex.min.js,katex.min.css,fonts/*}
#   Browser requests:  /vendor/katex/katex.min.js etc.
#   Same class of bug as FIX 3A: _routes.json excludes /vendor/katex/* from
#   the Function (correct) and _headers sets long-term caching on it
#   (correct), but without THIS rewrite the request 404s before either of
#   those ever matters. Symptom looked nothing like a 404 though: the
#   client's _cesEnsureKatexLoaded() catches the failed <script> load and
#   silently falls back to showing the raw, unrendered LaTeX source text
#   ($$...$$, \left, \frac still visible) instead of typeset math — no
#   console error surfaced to the chat UI, no broken-image icon, nothing
#   that looks like a missing file. Confirmed via cross-check: /vendor/
#   katex/* appears in _routes.json's exclude list and gets its own header
#   block in _headers, but had no entry at all in this file before this fix.

# FIX K2-M — Mermaid vendor assets: /vendor/mermaid/* → /public/vendor/mermaid/:splat
#   Physical location: public/vendor/mermaid/{mermaid.min.js,LICENSE}
#   Browser requests:  /vendor/mermaid/mermaid.min.js
#   IDENTICAL bug to FIX K2 above, same root cause, just never applied to
#   this vendor directory when it was added: _routes.json excludes
#   /vendor/mermaid/* from the Function (correct, confirmed present) and
#   _headers sets long-term caching on it via the [K2] block (correct,
#   confirmed present) — but this file had NO rewrite rule for it, so
#   every request 404'd before either of those ever mattered. Build output
#   directory for this project is repo root ("/"), not "public" — confirmed
#   via the Cloudflare Pages deployment details panel — so a physical file
#   at public/vendor/mermaid/mermaid.min.js is only reachable at
#   /public/vendor/mermaid/mermaid.min.js unless a rule like this one
#   rewrites the clean external path to it. Symptom: the client's
#   _cesEnsureMermaidLoaded() script tag 404'd, its onerror/hang path left
#   every ```mermaid fence's placeholder stuck showing raw diagram source
#   text in a monospace box — visually indistinguishable, at a glance, from
#   the diagram source never having been fenced/detected at all, which is
#   what made this take multiple rounds of client-side and prompt-side
#   fixes to isolate down to this single missing line.

/fonts/*                    /public/fonts/:splat                    200
/vendor/katex/*             /public/vendor/katex/:splat             200
/vendor/mermaid/*           /public/vendor/mermaid/:splat           200
/images/*                   /public/images/:splat                   200
/footing-pro/images/*       /public/footing-pro/images/:splat       200
/beam-pro/images/*          /public/beam-pro/images/:splat          200
/column-pro/images/*        /public/column-pro/images/:splat        200
/deflection-pro/images/*    /public/deflection-pro/images/:splat    200
/earthquake-pro/images/*    /public/earthquake-pro/images/:splat    200
/mur-pro/images/*           /public/mur-pro/images/:splat           200
/add-reft-pro/images/*      /public/add-reft-pro/images/:splat      200
/section-property-pro/images/* /public/section-property-pro/images/:splat 200
